Contributed by Asif Zaman (2026).

Problems correspond chapter-by-chapter to the following upcoming textbook:

A. Zaman, "Advanced Calculus in Several Variables", Springer (2027), to appear.

These are used for MAT237 Multivariable Calculus with Proofs at the University of Toronto. For any issues, please email asif.zaman@utoronto.ca. 

Currently the only user who should edit files in this subfolder is asif-z.  